2026-07-27T07:57:01.9055932Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-27T07:57:01.9122266Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T07:57:01.9122739Z i /tmp/RtmpWeppsc/duckdb
2026-07-27T07:57:01.9123063Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T07:57:01.9123757Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T07:57:01.9124255Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T07:57:01.9124755Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T07:57:01.9125454Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T07:57:01.9126017Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T07:57:01.9377113Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:57:01.9481272Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:57:01.9938595Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:57:02.0109645Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
